<title>SOUTH KOREA: SOCCER-RESULTS OF SOUTH KOREAN PRO-SOCCER GAMES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF SOUTH KOREAN PRO-SOCCER GAMES.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean</p>
<p>professional soccer games played on Sunday.</p>
<p> Pohang	5    Yukong	2   (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p> Daewoo	3    Taejon	0   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Standings after games played on Sunday (Tabulate under -</p>
<p>won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>			 W     D    L    G/F   G/A    P</p>
<p> Daewoo		3     0    0     6     1     9</p>
<p> Hyundai	     2     1    0     5     1     7</p>
<p> Pohang		2     0    1     6     4     6</p>
<p> Samsung	     2     0    1     2     2     6</p>
<p> Chonbuk	     1     1    1     5     4     4</p>
<p> Taejon		1     1    1     2     3     4</p>
<p> Chonnam	     1     0    2     1     2     3</p>
<p> LG		    0     2    1     3     4     2</p>
<p> Yukong		0     1    2     3     8     1</p>
<p> Ilwha		 0     0    3     1     5     0</p>
